# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Actions require Terraform 1.14 or later. An action keeps no state: it runs when
a resource's `lifecycle { action_trigger { events = [...] actions = [action.{{.Name}}.<name>] } }`
fires, or on demand with `terraform apply -invoke=action.{{.Name}}.<name>`.
Arguments go in the action's `config` block.

